set up mode native in 1 step:
  1. write [model-server] in /Users/user_name/.config/agent-wt/config.toml: mode = "native"; clear url and token_file
left alone and notes:
  - the LaunchAgent /Users/user_name/Library/LaunchAgents/local.wt-model.serve.plist is left installed and running
  - keep the local token file /Users/user_name/.config/wt-model/server.token
  - keep wt-model's LiteLLM pair (http://localhost:4000)
